  "ajo.cycleOpenedRegFeeFirstPeriod": { en: "Cycle opened. Note: this client has a registration fee + first-period commission — their first deposit covers both. Savings start from deposit 2.", pidgin: "Cycle don open. Note: this customer get registration fee + first-period commission — their first deposit go cover both. Savings go start from deposit 2.", ha: "An buɗe zagaye. Lura: wannan abokin ciniki yana da kuɗin rajista + kwamishan na lokacin farko — ajiyarsa ta farko za ta biya duka biyun. Ajiya za ta fara daga ajiya ta 2.", ig: "Emepela okirikiri. Rịba ama: onye ahịa a nwere ụgwọ ndebanye aha + kọmịshọn oge mbụ — ntinye ego mbụ ya ga-akwụ ha abụọ. Nchekwa ga-amalite site na ntinye nke 2.", yo: "A ti ṣí àyíká. Àkíyèsí: oníbàárà yìí ní owó ìforúkọsílẹ̀ + kọ́míṣọ̀n àsìkò àkọ́kọ́ — ìdáwó àkọ́kọ́ rẹ̀ yóò bo méjèèjì. Ìfowópamọ́ yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti ìdáwó kejì." },
