  "ajo.profile.regFeeNote":          { en: "Taken once, from the client's first deposit. It has no effect on a client who has already deposited.", pidgin: "We go take am once, from the client first deposit. E no go affect client wey don deposit before.", ha: "Ana ɗauka sau ɗaya, daga ajiyar farko ta abokin ciniki. Ba shi da tasiri ga wanda ya riga ya ajiye.", ig: "A na-ewe ya otu ugboro, site na ntinye ego mbụ onye ahịa. Ọ naghị emetụta onye ahịa tinyelarị ego.", yo: "A máa gbà á lẹ́ẹ̀kan, láti inú ìdáwó àkọ́kọ́ oníbàárà. Kò kan oníbàárà tó ti dá owó tẹ́lẹ̀." },
