  "ajo.profile.payoutAccountNoteOwner": { en: "Where money is sent when this client withdraws. Optional — required only when processing a withdrawal.", pidgin: "Na where money go go when this client withdraw. Optional — na only when you dey process withdrawal e need.", ha: "Inda ake tura kuɗi idan wannan abokin ciniki ya cire. Zaɓi ne — ana buƙata ne kawai lokacin sarrafa cirewa.", ig: "Ebe a na-eziga ego mgbe onye ahịa a wepụrụ ego. Nhọrọ — a chọrọ ya naanị mgbe a na-ahazi mwepụ.", yo: "Ibi tí a ó fi owó ránṣẹ́ sí tí oníbàárà yìí bá gba owó. Àṣàyàn ni — a nílò rẹ̀ nígbà tí a bá ń ṣe ìgbowó nìkan." },
