  "ajo.profile.payoutToWalletNote":  { en: "Withdrawal payouts go straight to this client's KudiAI Wallet, next business working day — no bank account to set up.", pidgin: "Withdrawal money go enter this client KudiAI Wallet straight, next working day — no need to set bank account.", ha: "Kuɗin cirewa na tafiya kai tsaye zuwa KudiAI Wallet na wannan abokin ciniki, a ranar aiki ta gaba — babu buƙatar saita asusun banki.", ig: "Ego mwepụ na-aga ozugbo na KudiAI Wallet onye ahịa a, n'ụbọchị ọrụ na-esote — ọ dịghị akaụntụ ụlọ akụ ị ga-edozi.", yo: "Owó ìgbowó máa lọ tààrà sí KudiAI Wallet oníbàárà yìí, ní ọjọ́ iṣẹ́ tókàn — kò sí àkáǹtì báǹkì láti ṣètò." },
  "ajo.profile.payoutAccountNoteCoop": { en: "The account where withdrawal payouts are sent. Optional — client can also set or update this from their portal or at the point of withdrawal.", pidgin: "Na the account where withdrawal money dey go. Optional — client fit set or change am from im portal or when e wan withdraw.", ha: "Asusun da ake tura kuɗin cirewa. Zaɓi ne — abokin ciniki zai iya saita ko sabunta shi daga shafinsa ko lokacin cirewa.", ig: "Akaụntụ a na-eziga ego mwepụ. Nhọrọ — onye ahịa nwekwara ike idozi ma ọ bụ melite ya site na portal ya ma ọ bụ mgbe ọ na-ewepụ ego.", yo: "Àkáǹtì tí a máa ń fi owó ìgbowó ránṣẹ́ sí. Àṣàyàn ni — oníbàárà náà lè ṣètò tàbí ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀ láti pọ́tà rẹ̀ tàbí nígbà ìgbowó." },
