  "ajo.profile.archiveNote":         { en: "The client and all their contribution history will be preserved but moved to the archived list. Their portal login will be deactivated. Enter your transaction PIN to confirm.", pidgin: "The client and all im contribution history go still dey but e go move to archived list. Im portal login go stop. Put your transaction PIN to confirm.", ha: "Za a adana abokin ciniki da duk tarihin ajiyarsa amma a matsar da su zuwa jerin da aka adana. Za a kashe shigarsa a shafi. Shigar da PIN ɗinka don tabbatarwa.", ig: "A ga-echekwa onye ahịa na akụkọ ntinye ego ya niile mana a ga-ebufe ha na ndepụta edobere. A ga-akwụsị nbanye portal ya. Tinye PIN azụmahịa gị iji kwado.", yo: "A ó pa oníbàárà náà àti gbogbo ìtàn ìdáwó rẹ̀ mọ́ ṣùgbọ́n a ó gbé e lọ sí àkójọ ìpamọ́. A ó pa ìwọlé pọ́tà rẹ̀. Tẹ PIN ìdúnàádúrà rẹ láti jẹ́rìísí." },
